%%   ## Two important GLMs
%%   {Logistic regression \\}
%%   
%%     * The response variable is usually binary and modeled with a
%%       binomial distribution.
%%     * The probability of success is usually a logit-linear
%%       model.
%%   
%%   \pause
%%   \vfill
%%   {Poisson regression \\}
